  "question": {
    "text": "Let $f, g: \\mathbf{R} \\rightarrow \\mathbf{R}$ be defined as :\n$f(x)=|x-1| \\text { and } g(x)= \\begin{cases}\\mathrm{e}^x, \\text { MARA } & x \\geq 0 \\\\ x+1, & x \\leq 0\\end{cases}$<br />Then the function $f(g(x))$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
