  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & f(g(x))=|g(x)-1| \\\\ & f o g\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}\\left|e^x-1\\right| & x \\geq 0 \\\\ |x+1-1| & x \\leq 0\\end{array}\\right. \\\\ & \\text { fog }\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}e^x-1 & x \\geq 0 \\\\ -x & x \\leq 0\\end{array}\\right.\\end{aligned}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/67p2RyqwuBcCWXIdB0onTLLxuNdUcOlhh0fAx3hYHzc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
